SUMMARY: Glory (1989)
DESCRIPTION:@ Market Video\n\n(DM for address): instagram https://www.ins
 tagram.com/marketvideotoronto/\n\nThe Platypus Affiliated Society organiz
 es reading groups\, public fora\, research and journalism focused on the 
 problems and tasks inherited from the "Old" (1920s–30s)\, "New" (1960s–70
 s) and post-political (1980s–90s) Left for the possibilities of emancipat
 ory politics today.\n\nThe Toronto chapter is hosting a screening of the 
 1989 civil war film Glory\, directed by Edward Zwick and starring Denzel 
 Washington and Matthew Broderick. Admittance is pay what you can. All are
  welcome and we hope you'll join us for drinks and discussion of the film
  after the screening.\n\nPWYC
CATEGORIES:Film,Market-Video,Discussion
