SUMMARY:Voices of Solidarity: Palestinian Stories\, Music and Scholarship
  on Turtle Island - by Office of Social Innovation at TMU
LOCATION:Church of the Holy Trinity
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/building-solidarity-tickets-2002479448937\n\n
 Hosted by Office of Social Innovation at TMU
  (https://www.torontomu.ca/social-innovation/)\n\nA keynote conversation
  with Palestinian legal scholar\, Hadeel Abu Hussein and Indigenous
  feminist researcher\, Megan Scribe. This critical discussion on law\,
  land\, resisting and dismantling colonialism\, and global Indigenous
  politics explores the politics of leading and supporting decolonial
  resistance on stolen land. 
END:VEVENT
