SUMMARY: Refrigerator Stories: A Search for Home
DESCRIPTION:(Living Room)\n\nA new solo show by Jos Dirkx\, directed by R
 eena Dutt\, with music direction by Sacha Hoedemaker. Nine real-life stor
 ies\, six original songs: starting in a classroom in Dakar with eleven ki
 ds from eleven countries\, moving through Toronto\, Helsinki\, Juba and A
 thens\, and arriving at a Dutch kitchen table where\, at 39\, Jos decides
  to step back on stage after all. A show about growing up between culture
 s\, a voice that disappears and comes back\, and love turning up when you
  least expect it. And what’s a refrigerator story? You’ll find out in the
  theatre.\n\nThe 2026 workshop performances will be the first time the co
 mplete show is performed for live audiences. In select venues\, each perf
 ormance is followed by a short conversation with the makers. The premiere
  will take place in 2027.
CATEGORIES:Storytelling,Concert,Tranzac
