SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Libraries
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20250827
DESCRIPTION:Part of the Think\, Research\, Create: Intro to Library Resea
 rch Series (3 out of 4)\nNot all information is created equally—and not 
 all search tools work the same way. This interactive workshop will help yo
 u compare popular tools for information discovery from AI to academic sear
 ch platforms. You’ll learn the differences between misinformation\, disi
 nformation\, malinformation\, AI hallucinations and deepfakes. We’ll sho
 w you practical fact-checking tools and strategies to help you figure out 
 what’s real and what’s not. You’ll also practice evaluating sources\
 , including academic ones\, so you can choose the most reliable informatio
 n for your assignments. By the end\, you’ll feel more confident navigati
 ng the information jungle!\n
