 ographer\, educator\, and workshop facilitator\, participants will discov
 er the art of flat stitch beadwork with this workshop designed specifical
 ly for beginner and intermediate beaders. Workshops are limited to a smal
 l number of participants to ensure a quality experience.\n\n\nRecommended
  for participants 14+. All materials included.
