DESCRIPTION:Address:\nDanu Social House\nStep-free entrance (ramp) and an 
 accessible washroom. All washrooms are single-stall and gender-neutral.\nT
 oronto\, ON\nCanada\n\nDo you like Toronto Event Generator? \nThen you mig
 ht like other people who also like it!!\nThis is a meet-up for people who 
 like Toronto Event Generator\, the events newsletter that I run. You might
  also enjoy it if you like some of my other events\, like: The Trampoline 
 Hall Lecture Series\, The All About Intimacy Discussion Series\, The Intro
 duction to Rope Bondage workshops I help with at Birdhaus\, and the This I
