 g. Complete it in as little as 12 months full-time\, or study part-time wh
 ile you work. Winter and Fall 2027 intakes are available. Learn more\nJoin
  one of the weekly drop-in sessions from October 20 to November 24 to lear
 n more:\n\nTuesday\, October 20\nDrop-in Session: Master of Engineering in
  Sustainable Energy Systems\n11 am – 12 pm\nRegister\n\nTuesday\, Octobe
 r 27\nDrop-in Session: Master of Engineering in Sustainable Energy Systems
