BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events": "https://events.yorku.ca/events/recovery-college-week-6-managing-academic-stress-exam-anxiety/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events
SUMMARY:Recovery College: YU & Balance Week 6 | Managing academic stress a
 nd exam anxiety
DTSTART:20261110T170000Z
DTEND:20261110T180000Z
DTSTAMP:20260901T143100Z
UID:MEC-ab5a47d41c51bcd432f515088a070b8b@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20261110T170000Z
SEQUENCE:4
CATEGORIES:Athletics &amp\; Recreation,Bethune College,Calumet College,Col
 leges,Faculties,Faculty of Health,Faculty of Liberal Arts &amp\; Professio
 nal Studies,Glendon,Health Education &amp\; Promotion,LA&amp\;PS Colleges,
 LA&amp\;PS Community Hub,LA&amp\;PS Founders College,LA&amp\;PS McLaughlin
  College,LA&amp\;PS New College,LA&amp\;PS Vanier College,Learning Commons
 ,Learning Skills Services,Stong College,Student Counselling, Health &amp\;
  Well-being,Students,the Atkinson Centre for Mature and Part-time Students
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260901
DESCRIPTION:Sometimes\, a single grade can get inside your head and make y
 ou question your ability to succeed in your program. The pressure to earn
  high marks\, often called “academic perfectionism”\, is something man
 y post-secondary students experience.\nIn this week’s session of YU & Ba
 lance\, participants will explore how stress affects academic performance 
 and learn practical strategies to manage it as you prepare for exam season
 . By the end of the session\, participants will have tools to recognize s
 tress\, respond to it effectively\, and protect your confidence during exa
 ms.\nThis session is part of a 6-week Recovery College series. For each se
 ssion attended\, participants will receive $5 on their YU-card. To receive
  the gift card\, you must attend the full session (approximately 45–60 m
 inutes). Unfortunately\, we’re not able to provide gift cards for partia
 l attendance. Gift cards will be emailed after the session to the same ema
 il address used to register and join the session.\nSpace is limited\, and 
 registration is offered on a first-come\, first-served basis. If the sessi
 on is full and you’d like to be added to the waitlist\, please email hst
 acey@yorku.ca ( mailto:hstacey@yorku.ca ). We’ll reach out if a spot bec
 omes available. If you’re registered but can no longer attend\, please l
 et us know as soon as you can so we can offer your spot to another student
 .\nRegister for Managing Academic Stress & Exam Anxiety ( https://yorku.zo
 om.us/meeting/register/Iv0LahZWQ-iOYdcg6Ikeyw )\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261001
LOCATION:Online (Zoom)
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/recovery-college-week-6-managing-academ
 ic-stress-exam-anxiety/
X-SOURCE:York University
END:VEVENT
