SUMMARY:Holocaust Education Week film screening - by OPSEU
LOCATION:Online
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://opseu.org/holocaust-education-week-film-screening-nov-10-2026-at-
 7-pm/\n\nHosted by OPSEU (https://opseu.org/)\n\nOPSEU/SEFPO’s Jewish
  Caucus invites you to join us for a special Holocaust Education Week
  virtual event. There will be a screening of the documentary Reckonings\,
  followed by a guided discussion exploring responsibility\, justice\,
  acknowledgment and healing in the aftermath of the Holocaust. 
END:VEVENT
