DESCRIPTION:Peer-Assisted Study Session (PASS) Leader: Yuffie\nThis Peer-a
 ssisted Study Session (PASS) is for : ADMS 3530 Finance Fall 2026.\nPartic
 ipate in weekly\, collaborative study sessions led by a peer who has succe
 ssfully completed the course. Review key concepts\, ask questions and disc
 over effective strategies to boost your confidence and academic success.\n
 Please Note: Any schedule changes or session cancellations will be communi
 cated through eClass. Students are encouraged to check eClass regularly fo
 r the most up-to-date information. During Fall Reading Week\, Peer-Assiste
 d Study Sessions\, Tutoring\, and Office Hours are typically not offered. 
 If a session is scheduled during this period\, details will be communicate
 d by the course instructor and posted in eClass.\nLearn more about PASS ( 
 https://students.yorku.ca/PASS ).\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261007
LOCATION:MK 2040\, Markham Campus
ORGANIZER;CN="Markham Campus Peer-Assisted Study Sessions":MAILTO:
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
