SUMMARY:Fueling Performance: The Real Deal on Sports Nutrition
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261111T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261111T170000
UID:6aa04011442d35226f676213@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Discover how food fuels performance in this interactive sessio
 n led by a registered dietitian. Learn what to eat\, when to fuel\, and ho
 w to spot nutrition myths. Build your own athlete meal plan\, test your kn
 owledge through games\, and explore exciting careers in sports\, health\, 
 and nutrition. Perfect for active teens looking to level up both on and of
 f the field.\n​Terence Boateng is a masters-trained (TMU - Health Commun
 ication) registered dietitian and certified exercise physiologist. He focu
 ses on providing nutrition counselling for weight management\, sports\, an
 d digestive health.
LOCATION:Malvern\, Youth Hub
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aa04011442d35226f676213
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
