 ple embroidered lavender flower on a piece of linen. Then sew the embroide
 ry into a small lavender sachet to create your own pleasant lightly scente
 d piece. Along the way\, participants will gain confidence with basic embr
 oidery techniques and hand-sewing skills.\nAll teens are welcome! Drop-in\
 , no registration required.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Yo
 uth Hubs are a welcoming place for teens after school and in the summer\, 
 where helpful staff are always available. Free\, nutritious snacks are of
 fered daily. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to fi
 nd out more.
