DESCRIPTION:Build Your Own Burrito Bowl at Teaching Kitchen!\nThink health
 y eating is expensive? Think again. Join York University’s Registered Di
 etitian\, Dahlia Abou El Hassan\, and York University’s Public Health Nu
 rses for a hands-on Teaching Kitchen where you’ll create a delicious\, b
 alanced burrito bowl using affordable ingredients.\nIn recognition of Diab
 etes Awareness Month and Financial Literacy Month\, we’ll explore:\n\nHo
 w to build balanced meals to support steady blood sugar levels\nBudget-fri
 endly meal planning strategies\nPractical nutrition tips for busy student 
 life\nEasy ways to eat well without overspending\n\nBonus: Stop by the Pri
 ce Match Dash at Vari Hall (noon to 1:30 p.m.) before the Teaching Kitchen
  to learn grocery shopping and price-matching tips that can help stretch y
 our food budget.\nOpen to students from all York campuses.\nRegister on Ev
 entBrite\n
