SUMMARY:Making Tracks: Indigenous Astronomy - by indigenous Sport &
  Wellness Ontario
LOCATION:Online
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://www.iswo.ca/event/making-tracks-indigenous-astronomy-7a269a04d2bd
 \n\nHosted by indigenous Sport & Wellness Ontario
  (https://www.iswo.ca)\n\nSamantha Doxtator is the first Indigenous woman
  to present at the renowned Hayden Planetarium. Her presentation weaves
  together traditional Indigenous knowledge and astronomical insights\,
  offering a perspective that communities across Turtle Island have called
  "medicine."
END:VEVENT
