SUMMARY: De Profundis: Oscar Wilde in Jail
DESCRIPTION:“There is no prison in any world into which love cannot force
  an entrance.”\n\nThis November\, Soulpepper Theatre is thrilled to bring
  back their award-winning musical adaptation of DE PROFUNDIS: OSCAR WILDE
  IN JAIL\n\nThe musical begins with Oscar Wilde languishing in a prison c
 ell\, cut off from the world that once adored him. As he writes a letter 
 to the man he loved—memory\, regret\, and desire crowd the silence—turnin
 g confinement into confession.\n\nIn this intimate\, 90-minute musical fa
 ntasy\, Robbie Ross and Bosie emerge through Wilde’s fractured memories a
 s as the plot thickens and audience are carried away by the original\, ge
 nre-spanning score that moves from Irish ballads to Broadway and electro-
 pop.\n\nWeaving together Wilde’s trial testimonies\, letters and epigrams
 \, De Profundis reveals Wilde unmasked: lover\, icon and exile—insisting 
 that even in the darkest places\, love can still reach us.\n\nOnstage at 
 Soulpepper Theatre for a limited run from November 3rd- November 29th\n\n
 Get your tickets today https://soulpepper.ca/whats-on/de-profundis-oscar-
 wilde-in-jail/ !
CATEGORIES:Dance---Performance---Theatre,Soulpepper-Theatre
