 portant Booking Details:\nClick the link below to select and book your pre
 ferred date and available time slot.\nLimit:\nStrictly\none booking per fa
 mily\nto ensure everyone gets a turn!\nWaitlist:\nIf registration is full 
 and no time slots are available\, please call the Agincourt Digital Innova
 tion Hub at\n416-396-3717\nto add your name to the waitlist.\nSpots are li
 mited and fill up fast!\nClick the link to reserve your slot today:\nhttps
