SUMMARY:Fighting to Win: A Course for Community and Union Activists - by
  The Leo Panitch School for Socialist Education
LOCATION:Venue to be shared with registrants
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://www.tickettailor.com/events/panitchschool/2329052\n\nHosted by
  The Leo Panitch School for Socialist Education
  (https://leopanitchschool.ca/)\n\nThis course will look at the forms of
  exploitation and oppression that exist in society and the means by which
  the power structure acts to limit and contain our struggles. The course
  will move towards a discussion of how our movements can overcome the
  factors that hold them back and to fight to win!
END:VEVENT
