SUMMARY:The Toronto-London Philosophy of Perception Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Speakers\nJames Stazicker (Kings College London) \nFrances Egan (Rutgers – New Brunswick) \nPeter Epstein (Brandeis University) \nGabriel Greenberg (University of California\, Los Angeles) \nAndrew Y. Lee (University of Toronto) \nAdrienne Prettyman (Bryn Mawr College) \nOrganizers\nSonia Sedivy (University of Toronto)\, Jacob Beck (York University)\, Bill Brewer (King’s College London)\, Kevin J. Lande (York University)\, Matthew Soteriou (University of Pittsburgh)\, and James Stazicker (King’s College London).
