SUMMARY:What Does Hate Actually Look Like in Schools? - by Harmony Movement
LOCATION:Online
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://harmony.ca/news/what-does-hate-actually-look-like-in-schools/\n\n
 Hosted by Harmony Movement (https://harmony.ca/)\n\nWhat happens when hate
  shows up at school? What makes students feel safe speaking up—and what
