DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261113T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261113T113000
UID:6ae9327296ec3a003adee519@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Chess Institute of Canada is inviting you to join our Chess fo
 r Life program - a fun and engaging chess program designed for seniors of 
 all skill levels. Whether you’re a seasoned player or interested in lear
 ning the game - enjoy friendly matches\, sharpen your strategy\, and conne
 ct with others in a relaxed\, supportive environment. Come make your move!
