SUMMARY:Drawing and Painting Geometric Patterns: The Symbolism and Complex
 ity of Islamic Patterns
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261113T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261113T160000
UID:6ad7e2e2901b02002cc3e5c3@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a creative workshop where you’ll learn the meani
 ng and beauty behind Islamic geometric patterns. Using a technique with se
 ven overlapping circles\, you’ll design your own pattern. You’ll also 
 choose colours inspired by Islamic art in architecture\, ceramics\, and te
 xtiles\, with guidance on mixing them. By the end\, you’ll have a unique
 \, hand-drawn and painted geometric design to take home!\n*\nRegistration 
 is required as spots are limited.
LOCATION:Gerrard/Ashdale
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ad7e2e2901b02002cc3e5c3
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
