DESCRIPTION:November is Make a Will Month and TPL is delighted to host the
  Ontario Bar Association. Learn about the importance of having a will and 
 powers of attorney for you and your family. Carissa DeMarinis\, a member 
 of the\nOntario Bar Association\nwho practices Will\, Trusts and Estates L
 aw will speak about the elements of a will\, what happens if you don’t h
 ave one\, what are powers of attorney\, why they are important\, and speci
 al considerations to keep in mind when preparing your estate and care plan
 s. Please note that this program is for general information only\, not fo
 r drafting individual wills.\nRegistration required\n. Drop-ins are welcom
 e until capacity is reached.
