 1c2599e757/6ae36b422dde9bfe42f49b30/scaled_1024.jpg
X-TKF-CUSTOM-PREVIEW:Toronto Aces & Aros is hosting a Showcase performanc
 e to celebrate the recent Ace Awareness Week and the launch of Issue # 3 
