 unday best\, sip your tips\, or ride that bender. Join us for a late chec
 k-out and reset your week at Wiggle Room at the Industry Weekly Social.\n
 \n#WiggleRoomToronto is the #HomeofBouncyBeats\n\nEvery funky Sunday fund
 ay\, at your service!\nwith Toronto's finest: MANZONE & STRONG https://on
 .soundcloud.com/yjJCoMeTijpVkmAEA and the Wiggly family.\nCOMPLIMENTARY E
 ntry before 10pm with RSVP\nOpen at 8pm\n\nit's a Sunday thang...\n\nSun 
