X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Public Library \u2014 Adults": "https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6adfb9e6de685359098bb795"}
X-SOURCE-ID:tpl_adults
SUMMARY:Dignity Memorial - Funeral Planning
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261117T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261117T120000
UID:6adfb9e6de685359098bb795@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a series of informative workshops designed to guid
 e you through planning meaningful funeral\, cremation\, and celebration-of
 -life services that reflect your loved one’s unique life\, values\, and 
 traditions. From personalized memorial options to pre-planning arrangement
 s\, Dignity Memorial will share helpful insights and practical information
  to help you create a heartfelt tribute that celebrates a life well lived 
 and leaves lasting memories for family and friends.\nReceive a free workbo
 ok\, spend time with other participants after the workshops\, and enjoy so
 me light refreshments provided.\nRegistration is required.\nFairview – R
 oom 201\n416-395-5750\n35 Fairview Mall Drive\, North York\, ON M2J 4S4\nI
 nformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is co
 llected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sec
 tions 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for eve
 nt and program registration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how
  the library handles your information can be directed to Answerline staff 
