DESCRIPTION:Does networking feel uncomfortable\, transactional\, or intimi
 dating? You’re not alone! Join our alumni panel to discover a more natur
 al approach to networking and learn how curiosity\, conversation\, and gen
 uine connection can build meaningful relationships.\nWhether you’re an i
 ntrovert\, changing careers\, or unsure where to start\, you’ll leave wi
 th simple strategies that make networking feel more natural and effective.
 \nDate: Tuesday\, Nov. 17\nTime: 12 – 1 p.m. ET\nFormat: Zoom meeting\
