DESCRIPTION:Address:\nQueen Books\nToronto\, ON\nCanada\n\nJoin us for the
  Toronto edition of Soju Club — an evening of Korean literature\, cultur
 e\, and soju\, led by award-winning Korean Canadian author\, literary tran
 slator\, and TikToker Jinwoo Park @jinwoopark0721. We’ll get into the hi
 story of soju\, share a few pours\, and a list of recommended reads from t
 he author himself. Jump into the conversation with a Q&A and discussion le
 d by Julia Parke\, founder of Asian Thought Club.\n\nYour ticket includes:
 \n• Three soju tastings\n• Korean snack pairings\n• A captivating le
 cture on the history of soju\n• A cozy introduction to 10 works of Korea
 n Literature\n\nHosted by Asian Thought Club
