BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Public Library \u2014 Teens": "https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6abc216511bbf300684a75fc"}
X-SOURCE-ID:tpl_teens
SUMMARY:Storytelling Using Data & AI
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261117T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261117T200000
UID:6abc216511bbf300684a75fc@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Your neighbourhood tells a story and the data to prove it alre
 ady exists. Let's learn to find real civic data about your community\, plo
 t it on an interactive map\, and turn what you discover into a powerful ad
 vocacy piece. No technical experience needed. Just curiosity about where y
 ou live and a desire to make it better.\nArrive 30 minutes before or stay 
 30 minutes after the program for one-on-one consultations.\nThis program i
 s part of TPL's Innovator in Residence series focused on civic innovation.
  From October 5 to November 28\, join programs\, workshops and one-on-one 
 consultations led by technology strategist Ismail Mohamud to learn how tec
 hnology can help you create positive change in your community. Learn more 
 at\ntpl.ca/iir\n.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal informatio
 n on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public
  Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will 
 only be used for event and program registration\, delivery and evaluation.
  Questions about how the library handles your information can be directed 
 to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Str
 eet\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Albert Campbell\, Second floor\, Digital Innovation Hub
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6abc216511bbf300684a75fc
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"YOHOMO": "https://www.yohomo.ca/event/when-the-dead-are-kept-from-us"}
X-SOURCE-ID:yohomo
SUMMARY:When The Dead Are Kept From Us
DTSTART:20261117T190000
DTEND:20261117T190000
UID:27284a8bd2aa889de13f93e844fb460a@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Queer Death Salon is a virtual community space for all 2SLGBTQ
 IA+ people to come together to discuss death\, dying and grief. How do we 
 honor our dead when they are kept from us? What happens to us when we are 
 denied our chance to mourn? Let&#x27\;s come together to learn about and p
 ractice building ritual for grief when we are othered. Colleen (ʻoia/they
 /them) of Death Doula Does will guide participants through practical skill
 s for honoring our mourning and grief in rituals when we have no body to h
 old. Colleen is a Kanaka Maoli\, Queer\, mutual aider\, community-oriented
  death doula. Supporting those dying\, caregivers for the dying\, and grie
 vers for over a decade\, their work focuses on art-based grief spaces\, qu
 eer end-of-life planning\, and teaching how to be with death. (FOR MORE IN
 FO SEE TICKET LINK PROVIDED)
LOCATION:Online\, online
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/when-the-dead-are-kept-from-us
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"YOHOMO": "https://www.yohomo.ca/event/yallternative-lines---kickoff-party"}
X-SOURCE-ID:yohomo
SUMMARY:Y&#x27\;allternative Lines - Kickoff Party
DTSTART:20261117T190000
DTEND:20261117T190000
UID:234e3d3f834d3296fe97d4d55027a57f@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to lasso your way onto the dance floor\, girls\, gay
 s\, theys\, and everyone in between! Y&#x27\;allternative Lines is here fo
 r our kickoff party - you won&#x27\;t want to miss this! Whether you’re 
 a seasoned liner or a curious new dancer\, we’d love for you to join us 
 in the joy of line dancing to your favourite divas and musical icons\, inc
 luding Britney Spears\, Charli XCX\, Rihanna\, Chappell Roan\, Janelle Mon
 áe\, Janet Jackson\, THOT SQUAD\, and more! Lessons start at 7:45 p.m. - 
 no prior dance experience is necessary to have a good time! Requests will 
 be taken throughout the evening for those coming with dances already in th
 eir pocket. Note to attendees: this event will include loud music\, flash 
 photography\, flashing lights\, and alcohol for sale at the licensed bar i
 n the space. (FOR MORE INFO SEE TICKET LINK PROVIDED)
LOCATION:Royal Canadian Legion Branch 10\, 1083 Pape Ave\, East York
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/yallternative-lines---kickoff-party
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
