DESCRIPTION:The Chess Institute of Canada invites you to join our Chess fo
 r Life program — a fun and engaging chess program for seniors of all ski
 ll levels.\nWhether you are a seasoned player or new to the game\, enjoy f
 riendly matches\, sharpen your strategy\, and connect with others in a rel
 axed\, supportive environment.\nCome make your move!\nRegistration require
 d.
