 \nLocation:\nJack Rabinovitch Reading Room\, Toronto Reference Library (78
 9 Yonge Street)\, 4th floor\nTime:\nDoors open 6:00pm\, Event starts 7:00p
 m.\nTickets:\nFree registration required.\nTicket policy:\nWe oversell the
 se events to ensure that the greatest number of people have an opportunity
  to attend. Tickets guaranteed until 6:45pm or until capacity is reached. 
 Seating first come\, first served\nAccessibility:\nTPL is committed to acc
 essibility. If you are Deaf or have a disability and would like to request
  accommodation for this event\, please contact accessibleservices@tpl.ca o
 r 416-393-7099 at least three weeks prior to the event.\n***\nInformation 
