 th York**\n* **Across the street from** **FINCH SUBWAY STATION**\n**near S
 hoppers Drug Mart**\n\n**###** ***📅*** **DAY:** ***Every*** ***Wednesda
 y***\n\n* **🕡 Time: 6:30 PM – 8:45 PM** **⏰**\n\n**Please register 
 ASAP** **if you want to attend on Sept 30th so we can save your spot!**\n\
 n***We had roughly 80 people sign up for the last two events... but we onl
 y have space for 30 people max.***\n**\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -**\n**After registering\, please do the following on Sept. 30th :**\n\n1.
  **✅ Do your best to arrive on time @ Café Princess (6:30 PM)**\n2. **
 ✅ Tell us whether you want to focus on learning/practicing ENGLISH or KO
 REAN**\n3. **✅ Tell us your level: Beginner\, Intermediate\, Advanced or
  Expert**\n4. **✅** **Buy 1 item from the Café Princess Menu** **(This 
 is the only cost if this is your 1st or 2nd class. There is an additional 
