UID:6ada53ebad4027659154af73@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for 4 weeks of fun afternoons where participants can c
 onnect over shared musical experiences while enjoying some light refreshme
 nts. Music Share for Seniors staff will play your favourite songs while yo
 u share the memories they inspire. Or sit back\, listen and enjoy the musi
 cal experiences of those around you. Get ready to jam out while connecting
  with new friends!\nMusic Share for Seniors is an organization dedicated t
 o reducing senior social isolation through personalized music-based progra
 ms and meaningful social interaction.\nThis program is geared towards olde
 r adults and seniors.\nRegister in advance or drop-in on the day. Particip
 ants are encouraged to join every week and connect with others!\nThursdays
 \, November 12\, 19\, 26\, December 3\n2:00 – 3:30pm\nInformation Collec
 tion Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the To
 ronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(
 c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for event and program re
 gistration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how the library hand
 les your information can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tp
 l.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
