DESCRIPTION:\n \n\n\n\nIf you think you have never met someone trans\, th
 ink again. In the store\, on the bus\, in the classroom\, and in the workp
 lace – trans folks of all kinds are everywhere. Hate and discrimination 
 is rapidly increasing in the world and trans folks are in desperate need o
 f good allies.\nJoin this workshop created and run by Brian Ginther to lea
 rn more about trans folks you live alongside and how you can support them 
 and their community. All are welcome. Space is limited. Registration is re
 quired – RSVP HERE  ( https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/how-to-be-a-trans-all
 y-in-the-workplace-classroom-tickets-2004244243485?aff=oddtdtcreator )\n\n
