DESCRIPTION:Thinking about pursuing your MEd or PhD degree?\nJoin us for t
 he Graduate Program in Education Info Session Night (Open House) to learn
  more about York University’s Graduate Program in Language\, Culture & T
 eaching – one of Canada’s most innovative and interdisciplinary progra
 ms.\nDate: Thursday\, November 19\, 2026\nTime: 4:00 – 5:30 p.m.\nLocati
 on: Grad Lounge – 113 Winters College (York University\, Keele Campus)\n
 During this session\, prospective students will:\n\nLearn about the progra
 m’s structure and areas of specialization\nMeet current students and fac
 ulty\nGet guidance on the application process\nDiscover how York supports 
 graduate students in advancing their scholarly and professional goals\n\nR
 SVP by November 9\, 2026 to attend this in-person event.\nRSVP HERE ( http
 s://educationforms.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.php?id=218812 )\nFor more
  information about the Graduate Program in Language\, Culture & Teaching\,
  visit: https://www.yorku.ca/edu/students/graduate-programs/ \n
