DESCRIPTION:These sessions are designated for community members to finaliz
 e and polish the work they’ve completed throughout the program duration 
 and are interested in displaying during the community showcase. The Innova
 tor In Residence will be in attendance to assist and offer advice.\nArrive
  30 minutes before or stay 30 minutes after the program for one-on-one con
 sultations.\nThis program is part of TPL's Innovator in Residence series f
 ocused on civic innovation. From October 5 to November 28\, join programs\
 , workshops and one-on-one consultations led by technology strategist Isma
 il Mohamud to learn how technology can help you create positive change in 
 your community. Learn more at\ntpl.ca/iir\n.\nInformation Collection Notic
