UID:6ae4bcab5ea4c386b3ebf794@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:When Rachel Chu agrees to spend the summer in Singapore with h
 er boyfriend\, Nicholas Young\, she envisions a humble family home\, long 
 drives to explore the island\, and quality time with the man she might one
  day marry. What she doesn't know is that Nick's family home happens to lo
 ok like a palace...\nJoin us for a conversation about the book\nCrazy Rich
  Asians\n. This is a registered program\, you can register online and pic
 k up a copy of the book in branch.
LOCATION:St. Clair/Silverthorn
