DESCRIPTION:We invite you to join us for a general graduate studies admiss
 ions drop in hour! Join us to ask any questions that you might have about 
 York University and our graduate admissions process.\nParticipants are abl
 e to ask questions via the Q&A feature\, and a representative will answer 
 each question out loud. Please note that during these sessions we will not
  be able to answer any questions about Schulich School of Business program
 s\, Osgoode Law School programs\, or the Professional Accounting diploma (
 PACC). For all other questions about graduate diplomas\, master’s progra
 ms\, and doctoral degrees\, we look forward to having you attend the event
 .\nRegistration is required. To RSVP or learn more\, visit yorku.zoom.us/m
 eeting/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN__guRJymkSAeYNs
 pCiNcaKw ).\nLearn more about our graduate programs at yorku.ca/gradstudie
 s/program-contacts/ ( http://yorku.ca/gradstudies/program-contacts/ )\n
