SUMMARY:GTApreneurs November 24\, 2026 Vaughan Business Networking Event
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Women in Business Networking Group (TWIB)\n\\*\\*To at
 tend\, you must **PURCHASE A TICKET** here: https://gtapreneurs.com/networ
 king-events-vaughan\n\nJoin us at an exciting Business Networking Event in
  Vaughan (1 block north of Toronto) on Tuesday November 24 where you can m
 eet potential clients and referral partners\, learn something new\, enjoy 
 a meal and promote your business!\n\n* **EVENT TIME:** 5:00-8:00pm\n* **FO
 OD SERVED:** 5:00-6:00pm\n* **VENUE:** Improve Canada\, 2nd floor auditori
 um\n* **ADDRESS:** 7250 Keele St\, Vaughan\, ON (Between Steeles Ave W. an
 d 407)\n* **PARKING:** Free\, onsite. Park on the NORTH SIDE of the buildi
 ng off of Snidercroft Rd\n\n**\\*\\*DIRECTIONS TO FIND THE ROOM:** Walk th
 rough entrance M\, go straight ahead until you get to the main aisle. Stra
 ight ahead will be a staircase. If you prefer to take the elevator\, make 
 a right at the main aisle\, go down a few stores and you will see it on th
 e left.\n\n**EVENT ITINERARY:**\n\n* **5:00-6:00pm:** Open networking\, fo
 od buffet\, visit exhibitor booths\n* **6:00-6:10pm:** GTApreneurs welcomi
 ng presentation\n* **6:10-6:30pm:** Guest Speaker Presentation: Chris Webb
 \, ***"Your Reputation\, Their Risk."***\n* **6:30-7:00pm:** Exhibitor Int
 roductions + member Elevator Pitches\n* **7:00-8:00pm:** Open networking\,
  visit exhibitors\n\n**TICKETS**\n\n* **GTApreneurs' Referral Group\, Exhi
 bitor and Mega Networking Members:** Free\n* **Non-members:** $25 in advan
 ce or $27 on event day\n\nNot a GTApreneurs Member? Go here to view our me
 mberships and register: https://gtapreneurs.com/business-networking-member
 ships\n\n**QUESTIONS ABOUT THE EVENT?**\nCall or text **Tammy** at (416) 5
 22-7770 or info@gtapreneurs.com.\n\nThis event will feature Guest Speaker 
 **Chris Webb**\, CEO\, IT Works Co. Chris is a technology and AI strategis
 t challenging business leaders to think bigger\, move faster\, and grow. A
 s CEO of IT Works Co and Sunshine ai\, with 25+ years of experience\, he
 ’s helping small business owners protect what’s important so they can 
 innovate confidently.\n\nContact **Chris** at (416) 657-4010 and visit [ww
 w.itworksco.com](www.itworksco.com) to learn more about his services.\n\n*
 *EXHIBITORS:**\n\n* **Abhishek Basak**\, Clerk Tech\, www.clerk-tech.com\n
 * **Balbir Pabila**\, PPLSI\\~LegalShield\, https://bkpabila.legalshieldas
 sociate.com\n* **Brad Aylward**\, BHA Mortgage Corp. Mortgage Architects L
 IC # 12728\, www.bhamortgagecorp.com\n* **Brian Pho**\, Oasis LLP\, www.oa
 sisllp.ca\n* **Moiz Ur Rehman**\, Allstate\, www.agents.allstate.ca/on/new
 market/17725-yonge-st-n/moiz-ur-rehman\n* **Robert Kennedy**\, Kennedy-Mar
 ques Real Estate Group\, [www.rjkennedyrealestate.com](www.rjkennedyreales
 tate.com)\n* **Sonia Kurmey**\, Arbonne\, www.soniakurmey.arbonne.com\n\n*
 *\\*Want to stand out?** Visit www.gtapreneurs.com/exhibitor to book your 
 exhibitor table\n\n\\*We will EMAIL you the GUEST CONTACT SHEET the day af
 ter the event by 5pm. If you don’t receive it in your inbox\, please che
 ck your SPAM/JUNK folder. Note: You must attend the event to receive the g
 uest contact sheet.\n\n**Want 1-1 help with your business?** Learn about T
 ammy Defoe's business coaching services here: https://gtapreneurs.com/abou
 t and https://gtapreneurs.com/business-coaching-toronto
