DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261124T200000
UID:6ae12c78de685359098c06a4@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join the November meeting of the East York Historical Society\
 , featuring author and architectural historian George Duncan.  George is a
  former East York resident and author of the book\nHistoric Unionville –
  a Village in the City\n.\nHe will be presenting on the artist\nThoreau Ma
 cDonald\n(1901-1989)\, who was the son of J.E.H. Macdonald and member of G
 roup of Seven.\n6:30 – Refreshments\, Meet & Greet\n7:00 – Welcome & R
 emarks\n7:15 – Presentation\n8:00 – Wrap up
LOCATION:S. Walter Stewart
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ae12c78de685359098c06a4
