UID:evt-dlsCwuEk0bXGCwT@events.lu.ma
DESCRIPTION:Address:\nSociety Clubhouse\nToronto\, ON\nCanada\n\nAbout Eve
 nt\nFor generations\, a detached house with a yard represented the typical
  image of a family home - the Canadian dream. But as that dream becomes a 
 pipe dream in cities like Vancouver and Toronto\, what comes next?\nJoin t
 he Missing Middle Initiative and About Here for a debut screening of “Is
  This Canada’s Next Family Home?”\, a film exploring the emergence of 
 multiplexes across the country\, and the forces that shape them. The scree
 ning will be followed by a panel discussion on the future of family-orient
 ed housing in Canada.\nSpeakers\nCara Stern\nCara Stern is a journalist de
 dicated to…\n\nHosted by More Neighbours Volunteer
LOCATION:Society Clubhouse\, 967 College St\, Toronto\, ON M6H 1A6\, Canad
 a
URL:https://luma.com/104jiudf
