DESCRIPTION:A representative from the\nCanada Revenue Agency (CRA)\nwill d
 iscuss how to recognize scams and fraud\, the different methods used by sc
 ammers\, how to protect your personal and financial information\, and what
  steps to take if you believe you have been targeted.\nPresented as part o
 f Financial Literacy Month.\nRegistration:\nThis virtual event is free to 
 join and will take place on\nZoom\n.\nRegister to receive an email with de
 tails on how to join the session. Join live\, as there will not be a recor
 ding for this event.\nCaptions will be available.\nNeed help with Zoom?\n-
 \nJoining and participating in a Zoom webinar\n-\nZoom Privacy Statement\n
 Information Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is c
 ollected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, se
 ctions 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for ev
