DESCRIPTION:Come join us for a radical retro rewind projected on the big s
 creen. Whether you're a first-time viewer or long-time fan\, these movies 
 are sure to please.\nNovember 5: Knives Out: Glass Onion (2022\, PG)\nNov
 ember 12: Hitch (2005\, PG-13)\nNovember 19: Forrest Gump (1994\, PG)\nNov
 ember 26: The Shawshank Redemption (1994\, 14A)\nDecember 3: Die Hard (1
 988\, 18A)\nDecember 10: Big (1988\, PG)\nDecember 17: The Holdovers (2
 023\, 14A)\nAll are welcome. Drop-in\, no registration required.
