 th improved privacy\nNavigate the Internet on your personal devices with i
 mproved privacy\nReduce privacy risks through the use of web browser plug-
 ins/extensions\nUnderstand the privacy considerations of using social medi
 a\nPre-Requisites\n: Some computer experience is\nrequired\n\; the ability
  to navigate app menus\, browsers\, and desktop computing features is desi
 rable.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this f
