DESCRIPTION:Address:\nJrew's\nToronto\, ON\nCanada\n\nHosted by Sauté Sun
 days Cookbook Club\n📅 November 29\, 6:15 PM – 8:30 PM\n📍 Jrew's\, 
 Toronto (165 Niagara Street)\n✨ Newsletter subscribers receive early acc
 ess before public release.\nNovember is our last table of the year.\nWe’
 re closing out 2026 with Ottolenghi Simple Too by Yotam Ottolenghi\, a boo
 k built around big flavour with short ingredient lists. Every recipe is ta
 gged by how it’s simple\, whether that’s ten ingredients or less\, thi
 rty minutes or less\, or make-ahead\, so there’s something here whatever
  your week looks like.\nWe’ll share dishes potluck-style and eat togethe
 r one more time…\n\nHosted by Saute Sundays
