 orkville-singles-mixer-age-35-and-under-free-for-ladies-tickets-2003410644
 167?aff=oddtdtcreator\n\nFREE for ladies for a limited time!\n\nJoin us fo
 r an evening of cocktails and singles\, in the heart of Yorkville Toronto.
  Free drink included. Free for ladies for a limited time.\n\nDress to impr
 ess and join us for an elegant evening of cocktails\, conversation\, and c
 onnections in the heart of Toronto’s prestigious Yorkville neighbourhood
 . The **Toronto Yorkville Singles Cocktail Mixer** is designed for classy\
 , confident singles **35 and under** who are looking to meet interesting n
 ew people in a sophisticated and relaxed atmosphere.\n\nYour ticket includ
 es a **FREE DRINK** to enjoy as you mingle and make connections at **The P
 owder Room**\, an upscale cocktail lounge at 129 Yorkville Ave. **Please a
 rrive before 9pm to receive your free drink ticket.**\n\nBest of all\, you
  can use our exclusive Meet & Click web application to Like or Pass on peo
 ple as you meet them. They will do the same for you\, and if the feeling i
 s mutual we will let you know the next day!
