 ile learning the basics of how to take a great photo.\nWhether you just wa
 nt to take better pictures on your smartphone or graduate to a professiona
 l DSLR or mirrorless camera\, join us for a class on the basics of digital
  photography. We will go over the basic settings that go into producing a 
 good photo and talk about camera settings\, lenses\, and lighting.\nRegist
 ration begins 2 weeks prior to class.\nCamera equipment will be provided f
 or this class\, however equipment is limited and participants may be asked
  to share. Participants are also welcome to bring their own camera.\nInfor
 mation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collec
