SUMMARY:Romance Book Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261203T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261203T200000
UID:6aedfab5035faf0033e1d251@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to the Romance Book Club\, where love stories take cen
 ter stage and every page promises a new adventure of the heart. Whether yo
 u're into slow burns\, second chances\, or enemies-to-lovers\, there's som
 ething here for every kind of romantic. Come read\, swoon\, and share your
  favorite moments with fellow book lovers.\nBrentwood's December Romance B
 ook Club meeting will be Bring Your Own Book. Attendees are encouraged to
  bring a favourite romance title to share with the group. A fun way to di
 scover new authors and titles!\nPlease note that this book club is for ind
 ividuals 18+.\nDrop in\, no registration required.
LOCATION:Brentwood\, Community Room\, Ground Floor.
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aedfab5035faf0033e1d251
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
