SUMMARY:North York Board Games Speed Dating (Ages 25-35)
DESCRIPTION:20s 30s Toronto Social & Activities\nNOTE: This is a paid even
 t. Please purchase a ticket to attend.\n\nTickets here: https://www.eventb
 rite.com/e/north-york-board-games-speed-dating-ages-25-35-tickets-20044547
 27047?aff=oddtdtcreator&keep_tld=true\n\nJoin us for a fun evening of spee
 d dating and board games. Go on short dates\, and who knows\, you might ju
 st meet that special someone!\n\nCalling North York\, Toronto singles!\n\n
 Join us for a fun and social evening of speed dating and board games where
  you'll meet up to 15 other singles on short dates and enjoy two hours of 
 free board games play after!\n\nHow Does Speed Dating Work? You will meet 
 members of the opposite sex for quick dates\, and then you will give them 
 a Like or Pass on your phone. They will then do the same thing for you. If
  there is a mutual match\, contact information will be exchanged the next 
 day.\n\nAfter speed dating ends\, stick around and play board games with y
 our new friends!\n\n**IMPORTANT:** Please sign up for a profile at **www.1
 5firstdates.ca** and use the same email that you used on Eventbrite. We wi
 ll be using our web app to run the event. You need a profile to participat
 e.\n\nWe will give you all needed materials\, and explain the process to y
 ou once everyone has arrived.\n\n**This event is for singles aged 25-35**.
  Get your tickets now while you can!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/20s-30s-toronto-social-activities/eve
 nts/317304923/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261105T215420Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261105T215420Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
