UID:6ae35da5198b996a80a952e9@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Created by Business in the Streets (BITS)\, The Playbook Work
 shop is an engaging\, hands-on workshop designed to help creative women u
 nderstand how to turn their ideas into sustainable businesses. Through gu
 ided discussion\, storytelling\, and practical exercises\, participants ex
 plore what makes a business idea strong\, how to start with limited resou
 rces\, and how to find the right audience for their work.
