SUMMARY:The Marvel & DC Book Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261207T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261207T200000
UID:6a958c6337716d0d1ad75c62@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Whether you are an avid Marvel and/or DC fan\, or have never r
 ead a comic before but would like to\, join our Marvel/DC book club where 
 we will read a wide variety of graphic novels about these amazing heroes!\
 nNo September meeting\nOctober 5:\nGhost Rider\n: Unchained by Benjamin Pe
 rcy and Cory Smith & Brent Peeples (ebook available as well)\nNovember 2:\
 nWonder Woman\n:\nParadise Lost by Phil Jimenez\, with co-scripting by J.M
 . DeMatteis & Joe Kelly and co-plotting by George Pérez & Devin Grayson (
 ebook available as well)\nDecember 7:\nDaredevil\n: Know Fear by Chip Zdar
 sky and Marco Checchetto (ebook available as well)\nParticipants are expec
 ted to pick up the respective books themselves.
LOCATION:Lillian H. Smith\, Room A
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a958c6337716d0d1ad75c62
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
