DESCRIPTION:Bring the beauty of nature to your holiday decor. During this 
 beginner-friendly workshop\, discover how to design and assemble your own 
 custom holiday baubles using a curated selection of real\, pre-pressed blo
 ssoms. This program blends creative expression with a mindful\, nature-foc
 used craft. Participants will leave with beautiful\, one-of-a-kind ornamen
 ts to keep as a decoration or give as gift.\nAll materials will be provide
 d.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form 
 is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\
 , sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used fo
