DESCRIPTION:Have fun with the whole family while sharing favourite songs a
 nd rhymes to stimulate language. We will delight in the best books to spar
 k a love of reading! The last 30 minutes of the program will be stay and p
 lay.\nDrop-in. Space is limited.
LOCATION:Maria A. Shchuka\, Children's Program Room
