SUMMARY:Holiday Saxophone Concert with Sidecar78
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261211T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261211T113000
UID:6aee33a296ec3a003adfd8b2@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Swing into the holiday season with Sidecar78. Enjoy a morning 
 of festive saxophone peppered with jazz and swing tunes to set your holida
 y mood. Sidecar78 is a Toronto-based saxophone quartet with a songbook con
 taining everything from jazz and ragtime to classical and contemporary sta
 ndards in arrangements that showcase the outstanding musicianship of the e
 nsemble. The members of Sidecar78 - three retired music teachers and a rec
 ord company executive - have shared their enthusiasm for the unique and co
 smopolitan sound of the saxophone since establishing the quartet in 2016.
LOCATION:Jane/Sheppard\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aee33a296ec3a003adfd8b2
