DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261212T150000
UID:6ad63a30e06996003a8482d1@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:For an hour\, it is your choice whether you join us to listen\
 , draw\, read\, knit\, write\, look out the window\, or simply sit and sha
 re space with like-minded individuals.  The soothing sounds of harp and wo
 oden flutes accompany this opportunity to relax and step away from the act
 ivity and stress of the day.\nDrop-in.
LOCATION:Ethennonnhawahstihnen'\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ad63a30e06996003a8482d1
