SUMMARY:City Walk - Uptown\, Midtown\, Northtown Meander
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261213T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261213T130000
UID:7217d4f2d5c2ffe46ad5a61d912c6e95@tbn.ca
DESCRIPTION:Today\, Julie will lead us on an 14 Km end-to-end walk startin
 g near St Clair Ave W and Avenue Rd. We will walk through some Toronto nei
 ghbourhoods from South of St Clair\, west as far as Bathurst\, then north 
 of Lawrence\, and east past Avenue Road. We will end near the Avenue Stati
 on of Line 5 - Eglinton Crosstown LRT. The apres will be Thairoomgrand Mid
 town (288 Eglinton Ave W). Meet at about 10:00 AM at the Starbucks in the 
 Imperial Oil Building (111 St Clair Ave W)\, about 500 m west of St Clair 
 Subway Station (Line 1 - Yonge/University). The walk will begin at 10:10 A
 M. We will be close to Bathurst\, Lawrence\, Glencairn and Avenue Road bus
  routes\, as well as Forest Hill and Chaplin LRT stati...
LOCATION:the Starbucks in the Imperial Oil Building (111 St Clair Ave W)\,
  about 500 m west of St Clair Subway Station (Line 1 - Yonge/University)
URL:https://www.tbn.ca/widget/event-6594585
