DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261216T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261216T170000
UID:6aee3fee3c35b95bcb2a3872@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:A free\, culturally affirming drop-in program for adults that 
 promotes mental wellness through creative activities\, discussion\, and he
 althy coping strategies. Guided by the concept of Sankofa\, participants e
 xplore connections between past experiences and present wellbeing while bu
 ilding skills for managing stress and supporting mental health. Activities
  vary based on community interests and needs.\nDrop-in welcome. No registr
 ation required.\nThis program is in collaboration with\nTAIBU Community He
 alth Centre.
LOCATION:Cedarbrae - Closed\, PROGRAM ROOM
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aee3fee3c35b95bcb2a3872
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
