DESCRIPTION:Join us for a monthly film screening of\nThe Old Oak\n(2023\, 
 Rated 14A).\nWhen a group of Syrian refugees move into a floundering Engli
 sh village\, a decisive rift fueled by prejudices develops between the com
 munity and its newest inhabitants. The formation of an unexpected friendsh
 ip between TJ and a young Syrian woman named Yara opens up new possibiliti
 es for the divided village.\nDrop-in.
