 ooks\, then transform them into a fun art project! Using the existing page
 s\, we’ll create pockets\, windows\, doors\, secret compartments\, & mo
 re.\nLearn fun techniques for altering books! Take home a project you can 
 continue working on long after the workshop ends.\nNo experience necessary
 \, all are welcome! This is a workshop for teens/youth.\nInformation Colle
 ction Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the T
 oronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20
