SUMMARY: Tribal & Bounce: SAEED YOUNAN | WR Records Release Party
DESCRIPTION:Sat Dec 19: SAEED YOUNAN https://soundcloud.com/saeedyounan\n
 TAKiN | 3ROC | Melanie Sutherland [bday beats]\n\n\nTribal house master S
 aeed Younan lands at Wiggle Room Toronto for a special release party cele
 brating his debut release on Wiggle Room Records. Founder of the renowned
  Younan Records\, Saeed returns to Wiggle Room to bring the tribal rhythm
 s\, hypnotic grooves and dance floor fire he’s known for. He will be join
 ed by Wiggle Room label boss TAKiN\, along with 3ROC and birthday beats f
 rom Melanie Sutherland.\n\nAdvance Tickets: https://wiggleroomtoronto.com
 /event/tribal-bounce-saeed-younan-wr-records-release-party/\nEarly Wiggle
 r: $20\nThe Wiggler: $25\n\n https://www.beatport.com/release/i-dont-depe
 nd-on-you/7092756\nPerformances: https://www.beatport.com/label/wiggle-ro
 om-records/109275\n10-12 Melanie Sutherland [bday]\n12-1 TAKiN\n1-4 SAEED
  YOUNAN\n4-close 3ROC\nVJ Amir Nian\n\n\n#WiggleRoomToronto is the #Homeo
 fBouncyBeats\nOptions for prepaid table/ticket packages (ONE ticket = eve
 rything mentioned):\n\n1) The 3rd Wheel: $363\nincludes: 3 General Admiss
 ions\; 1 Bottle of Stoli Vodka\n\n2) Regular Package: $700\nincludes: 6 G
 eneral Admissions\; 2 Regular Bottles of Choice (may email wigglyevents@g
 mail.com mailto:wigglyevents@gmail.com to specify choice)\n\n3) Premium P
 ackage: $900\nincludes: 6 General Admissions\; 2 Premium Bottles of Choic
 e (email wigglyevents@gmail.com mailto:wigglyevents@gmail.com to specify 
 choice)\n\nTo Arrange Special Packages - wigglyevents@gmail.com mailto:wi
 gglyevents@gmail.com (sold separately from admission)\n\nATM on site\nFul
 l Bar Service\n21+ event\n\nhosted by: Wiggle Room Records\; 1lvl1 Entert
 ainment\; Wiggly Events\; and Wiggle Room Toronto\; Sunshine Frequencies\
 ; OG Entertainment\n\n~ WiGGLE RESPONSIBLY ~\nWe have a strict code of co
 nduct and reserve the right to refuse anyone at any time. Wiggle Room is 
 a Safer Dance Space. We take this very seriously. We encourage everyone n
 ot to hesitate to bring to our attention anything you think that we shoul
 d be made aware of\, such as harassment\, violation of personal space\, s
 olicitation or use of controlled substances\, over-intoxicated behaviour\
 , or anything else that may pose a risk or discomfort to you or others. Y
 ou may use the safe word BANANA\, ask any of our staff for a Banana\, and
  we will direct you to a safe\, quiet space. Our security staff are in ma
 rked clothing. Our team and event hosts\, such as Takin\, Lindsay Fay\, N
 our Bawab\, Christina Barron\, Tyler Hill\, Mitch (lead security)\, and T
 anya\, are all available.\n\n~ Wiggle Wiggle ~\n772 Dundas St West
