SUMMARY:Youth Hub: Beginner Dungeons & Dragons
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261221T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261221T180000
UID:6ac3e8999d27a000454ec1c7@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to the wonderful world of Dungeons and Dragons! Join 
 us for this tabletop role playing game as we explore a medieval fantasy wo
 rld full of adventures and danger.\nThis is a drop-in adventure featuring 
 first level characters\, designed for new players and returning players w
 ho want to build their confidence. Space is limited to six players\, but 
 guests and spectators are also welcome!\nThis program is part of Youth Hub
  service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for teens after school and in t
 he summer\, where helpful staff are always available. Free\, nutritious s
 nacks are offered daily. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the 
 branch to find out more.
LOCATION:Maria A. Shchuka\, Youth Hub
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ac3e8999d27a000454ec1c7
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
