UID:6ac7d61e295b3b0033caf72f@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy sophisticated music to remember performed by a quartet o
 f lady saxophone players\, Little Black Dress.  The group performs four-pa
 rt harmony music on four different saxophones and offers a wide repertoire
  of music including classics\, swing\, show tunes and seasonal holiday mus
 ic. They will also provide a brief description of the different saxophones
  and a demonstration of how each instrument sounds.\nRegistration required
 .\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form i
 s collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\,
  sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for
