BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Public Library \u2014 Older Adults": "https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a3d8305f0a66233671b0e45"}
X-SOURCE-ID:tpl_older_adults
SUMMARY:Community Writing Workshop
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261229T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261229T193000
UID:6a3d8305f0a66233671b0e45@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Experience the transformative power of writing in an inclusive
  space!\nA Writers Collective of Canada (WCC) workshop is unlike any other
 . We write together\, share first drafts in an encouraging environment\, l
 isten deeply to one another\, and receive supportive feedback. Tap into yo
 ur story and explore your voice in an environment of dignity\, courage\, a
 nd respect.\nNo experience required. Beginners are welcome. Materials are 
 provided.
LOCATION:Parliament Street\, Main Floor Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a3d8305f0a66233671b0e45
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Public Library \u2014 Teens": "https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ad23bc49d27a000455153b5"}
X-SOURCE-ID:tpl_teens
SUMMARY:All Ages Karaoke and Board Game Night
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261229T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261229T193000
UID:6ad23bc49d27a000455153b5@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:It's not everyday that you can stand in the spotlight on a the
 atre stage. Shake off stage fright and sing your favourite tunes on our s
 tage in a fun\, encouraging environment. Request any music/karaoke video 
 on Youtube and we'll play it for you! If singing is not your thing\, a few
  board games will be on hand if you want to try out Catan\, Anomia\, Ticke
 t to Ride\, or test your vocabulary with Scrabble! You are also welcome to
  bring your own and invite others to play with you.\nChildren must be acco
 mpanied by an adult.
LOCATION:Palmerston\, Lower Level
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ad23bc49d27a000455153b5
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
