DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261230T134500
UID:6ae8c76e377296003a506a8a@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join Dr. Bonkers as the colourful entertainer brings joy to ki
 ds and families! With music and instruments\, Dr. Bonkers and his best pup
 pet friend\, Larry\, teach lessons about friendship\, kindness\, and imagi
 nation. Through vibrant sing-alongs and fun antics\, Dr. Bonkers offers an
  unforgettable experience filled with laughter\, music\, and dancing!\nFor
  children of all ages and their families. Tickets will be handed out at t
 he children's desk 30 minutes before the program. Space is limited.
LOCATION:S. Walter Stewart\, Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ae8c76e377296003a506a8a
