DESCRIPTION:Let the countdown to 2027 begin. Come celebrate the New Year a
 t the Riverdale branch! We will be hosting a Noon Year's party with specia
 l activities. Culminating in a countdown to noon on the last day of the ye
 ar!\nFor children ages 3 and up.\n*Space is limited. Registration is requi
 red. Please register online or call the Riverdale branch at 416-393-7720 o
 r register in person.
LOCATION:Riverdale\, Program Room 1
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ad8f147e9f71840dd72aecc
