DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261231T200000
UID:87fed8b8a495984680257be828a4a658@tbn.ca
DESCRIPTION:Let's ring in the New Year together with a casual evening of c
 ycling friends\, good company and a little bike-themed fun! Join us from 6
 :00 pm onwards for a relaxed and fun gathering! Cycling attire (especially
  your favourite TBN gear!) or ugly holiday sweaters are encouraged\, but n
 ot required. A few details: Snacks and water will be provided\, perhaps so
 me appetizers but not a real "entree" type dinner. Bring your own beverage
 s and anything else you'd like to drink. Feel free to bring your own food 
 to eat or share\, or order delivery onsite. Party room with kitchen area\,
  fridge and microwave. Also sheltered outdoor area with seating and a gril
 l. Have a favourite song? Send us your requests for...
