SUMMARY:Seniors' Social: Bead\, Chat\, and Create
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20270106T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20270106T110000
UID:6ada765c901b02002cc46b96@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a fun and relaxing program just for SENIORS and OL
 DER ADULTS! Our Senior Club program includes simple exercises to support y
 our health\, engaging puzzles and brain games for mental stimulation\, dig
 ital learning classes to build new skills\, crafts\, and opportunities to 
 socialize\, share experiences\, and make new friends.\nEnjoy a relaxing an
 d social bracelet-making session designed for seniors and older adults. Cr
 eate a simple bracelet using beads and other craft materials while chattin
 g and connecting with others. No experience is needed. Come have fun\, mee
 t new friends\, and take home a handmade bracelet.\nThis program involves 
 small beads and craft materials.\nRegistration spots not claimed within 5 
 minutes of the program start time will be given to drop-in participants.
LOCATION:Steeles
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ada765c901b02002cc46b96
