 s. Learn more at our website: https://www.yorku.ca/teachingcommons/certif
 icates/#AIPedagogies\nIn this workshop we examine the risks of efficiency-
 driven AI use and explore how to reframe AI as a tool for learning\, refle
 ction\, and deeper engagement. Join us for strategies to connect with and 
 motivate your students while engaging them with AI.\nVisit YULearn to regi
 ster: https://yulearn.yorku.ca/local/yulearn/learning_opportunity.php?id=2
 144 ( https://yulearn.yorku.ca/local/yulearn/learning_opportunity.php?id=2
 144 )\n
