X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Public Library \u2014 Young Adults": "https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aea61bc9b955d531f7cddb0"}
X-SOURCE-ID:tpl_young_adults
SUMMARY:Advanced English Conversation Circles (Level 5 & up) with WoodGree
 n
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20270117T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20270117T153000
UID:6aea61bc9b955d531f7cddb0@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:If you are a newcomer to Canada and want to enhance your Engli
 sh communication skills\, this free program is for you! Please note\, this
  is an opportunity to practice your conversational skills—it is not a f
 ormal English class.\nThis program is in partnership with WoodGreen Commun
 ity Services.\nAfter registering online\, you will be contacted by WoodGre
 en staff to complete your registration.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nT
 he personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Li
 brary under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d).
  The information will only be used for event and program registration\, de
 livery and evaluation. Questions about how the library handles your inform
 ation can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-39
