SUMMARY:Adult Afternoon Movie - Spa Weekend (2026)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20270126T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20270126T160000
UID:6aecc6359dbc2b002c939366@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Three best friends\, Jane (Leslie Mann)\, Coco (Michelle Butea
 u) and Sophie (Anna Faris)\, as they embark on some  much-needed pamperin
 g during a luxury spa weekend in Palm Springs. But when their trainwreck f
 riend\, Mel (Isla Fisher)\, turns up\, the relaxation quickly descends int
 o chaos with hilarious consequences.\nR\, 97 minutes\n**Subtitles for the 
