SUMMARY:4th Wednesday Book Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20270127T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20270127T153000
UID:6ab2809a607483003828b36b@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to\nDeer Park's 4th Wednesday Book Club\n! We meet mon
 thly to discuss a variety of books chosen by our members.\n2026 Schedule:\
 nJan. 28.\nThe Vanishing Half\nby Brit Bennett\nFeb. 25.\nHorse\nby Gerald
 ine Brooks\nMar. 25.\nThe Marriage Portrait\nby Maggie O'Farrell\nApr. 22.
 \nThe Adversary\nby Michael Crummey\nMay 27.\nAuthor Talk\nwith\nCathy Mar
 ie Buchanan\nJun. 24.\nJames\nby Percival Everett\nSummer Break for July &
  August\nSept. 23.\nThe Years\nby Annie Ernaux\nOct. 28.\nGilead\nby Maril
 ynne Robinson\nNov. 25.\nRage the Night\nby Donna Morrissey\nDec. 09.\nLoo
 k at the Lights\, My Love\nby Annie Ernaux\nInformation Collection Notice:
 \nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public
  Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(
 d). The information will only be used for event and program registration\,
  delivery and evaluation. Questions about how the library handles your inf
 ormation can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416
 -397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Deer Park\, Room 204 (upstairs)
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ab2809a607483003828b36b
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
