BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events": "https://events.yorku.ca/events/vcp-presents-bipoc-artist-hub-showcase-2/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events
SUMMARY:VCP presents BIPOC ARTIST HUB SHOWCASE
DTSTART:20270129T000000Z
DTEND:20270129T020000Z
DTSTAMP:20261013T203000Z
UID:MEC-e7010b9fb43e91b36e43b374ce2d7454@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20270129T000000Z
SEQUENCE:4
CATEGORIES:Black History Month,LA&amp\;PS Colleges,LA&amp\;PS Open to the 
 Public,LA&amp\;PS Student Success,LA&amp\;PS Students All,LA&amp\;PS Vanie
 r College Productions
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20261013
DESCRIPTION:Vanier College Productions (VCP) is excited to continue with t
 he first-ever BIPOC Artist Hub at York University. Open to all BIPOC artis
 ts (theatre\, dance\, music\, film\, visual art\, design\, writing\, etc.)
  at York\, the group meets every Tuesday from 4:30-6:30pm. Now in its sixt
 h year\, join us for discussions\, creative collaboration\, and help bring
  our annual showcase to life.\nStarting in September\, students from VCP
 ’s BIPOC Artist HUB will be working towards bringing a themed arts showc
 ase to life.\nThis year\, patrons and audiences can get an exclusive look 
 at the featured art exhibits\, in advance of the showcase! In January\, st
 op by Vanier College\, Room 001 between 9am-4pm\, Monday-Friday\, to catch
  all the amazing artwork on display.\nWant to see more from the HUB? Join 
 us for our BIPOC Artist HUB Showcase happening Jan. 28-30. With exhibits t
 hat range from visual art\, board games\, live performances\, and more\, w
 e hope to transport you to other worlds with our personal stories\, reflec
 tions and ideations.\nDirected by Alex Jyn-Li Cairns\nAssistant Directed b
 y Heba Azeef\nStage Managed by Aria Vermiglio\nJan. 28-30\, 2027\n7-9pm\nF
 red Thury Studio Theatre\, 258 Vanier College\nTo reach the theatre\, take
  the stairs or elevator on the east side of Vanier College to the second f
 loor.\nPay-What-You-Can-Afford Tickets\nSuggested Pricing: VCP Supporter $
 50 | General $25 | VCP Alumni $20 | Students $15 | VCP Current Company $10
 \nAvailable online or CASH ONLY at door\nWebsite: BIPOC Artist Hub – Van
 ier College Productions at York University ( https://www.yorku.ca/laps/vcp
 /current-season/bipoc-artist-hub/ )\nEmail: vcp@yorku.ca ( mailto:vcp@york
 u.ca )\nFacebook: @VanierCollegeProductions\nInstagram: @vancproductions\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261105
LOCATION:Fred Thury Studio Theatre\, 258 Vanier College
ORGANIZER;CN="Shania Mendes":MAILTO:smendes@yorku.ca
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/vcp-presents-bipoc-artist-hub-showcase-
 2/
X-SOURCE:York University
END:VEVENT
