X-SOURCE-ID:tpl_older_adults
SUMMARY:English Conversation Circle
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20270129T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20270129T110000
UID:6acfde729d27a0004550f0e9@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Are you learning English or new to Canada?\nPractice your Engl
 ish conversation skills in a relaxing environment while making new friends
  and learning about what the library has to offer!\nPlease note that this 
 is not a formal English class.\nThis program is offered in partnership wit
 h Catholic Crosscultural Services. Contact Qudsia at 647-801-3222.
LOCATION:Malvern\, New Programming Space
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6acfde729d27a0004550f0e9
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
