SUMMARY:Baby Time
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20270129T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20270129T110000
UID:6aea295a901b02002cc728a1@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for bouncing rhymes\, songs and stories in this progra
 m for babies\, birth to 18 months\, and their parents or caregivers. Baby
  Time runs from\n10:30am to 11:00am\n.
LOCATION:Main Street\, Second floor children's department
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aea295a901b02002cc728a1
