DESCRIPTION:Looking for something to do after school? Come out to our Afte
 r School Club and learn new things\, make stuff\, meet other kids and have
  fun!\nSnacks are offered during the After School Club for participants. I
 ngredient lists will be available. Snacks are generously supported\, in pa
 rt\, by donors.\nFor children ages 6-12. Drop-in.
