DESCRIPTION:Looking for something to do after school? Come out to our Afte
 r School Club and learn new things\, make stuff\, meet other kids\, and ha
 ve fun!\nDrop-in. For ages 6-12.\nNote: Snacks are offered during the Afte
 r School Club for participants. Food may contain or have come into contac
 t with common allergens. Ingredient lists will be available. Snacks are ge
 nerously supported\, in part by donors.\nPlease note that this is a drop-i
 n program\, but space is limited.
LOCATION:Ethennonnhawahstihnen'\, Program Room
